ection><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>时间：2026年7月5日下午14:00—15:30</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>3</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>文学院开放日系列讲座（二）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2u8dY6WnMgO6ibZDJvMPtRVzp3eOaickqZeIehXkjTCnlS27iccsPGn9bBlgOYG4ZPACqPvDp8H8x0leg0pk19DXKdYIk8k5icTz5z5JL1muLQ8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/2u8dY6WnMgNWXXdLhGrfmmmHATjujD3Kws6yVVmWdMsS6Eayx8XMalibNPBcxwTs14WcchRqbVLhajYmZkm5WwH7Wd7eYAX4a4y5JVKMpWX4/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>主讲人：徐烨 助理研究员</span></p><p><span>主持人：张福通 副教授</span></p><p><span>讲座题目：《朝鲜半岛的汉语语料概说》</span></p><p><span>嘉宾简介：南京大学文学院助理研究员，主要从事朝鲜语史、早期中朝日的语言接触、中朝语言文化交流史、朝鲜半岛的汉语语料研究。代表性论文有《Fó (佛), Pwuche (仏体) and Hotoke (保止氣)》《Revisiting jīng (椋) on the Ancient Korean Peninsula》《고대한국어에 나타난 거주지 단위에 대한 재고찰》《新羅〈慧超往五天竺國傳〉再考》《崔世珍事行考》《吏文諸書輯覽에 대한 재고찰》《Revisiting yuluoxia (於羅瑕) and jianjizhi (鞬吉支)》等。</span></p><p><span>推荐书目：汪维辉，《朝鲜时代汉语教科书十种汇辑》，上海教育出版社2022年版。</span></p><p><span>张伯伟主编，《高丽朝鲜时代中国行纪资料汇编》，凤凰出版社2026年版。</span></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>时间：2026年7月5日下午15:40—17:10</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>4</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>文学院开放日系列讲座（三）</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2u8dY6WnMgP7qWX0LicK73B0yRQxlO2iaEaLYK48wFmjlvWSWQSnY2bgmI5n30Lcsye0l8Lx7jNg0ZvOia5p1kuCsuQgRJ5bVjibsDxWgFCnolg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/2u8dY6WnMgPj7m7Ag3317aaePophRXcGKia5yIGqHvCJdOXYlXricKY4YEq6VEUGajaEbkyuib3hrnjq93vs8nx5QZZLdgDzSzFMUUHOTiclUYQ/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>主讲人：刘超 教授</span></p><p><span>主持人：李章斌 教授</span></p><p><span>讲座题目：《吃什么、看什么才有“营养”——营养概念在现代中国的语义变迁》</span></p><p><span>嘉宾简介：南京大学文学院教授、博士生导师，并担任中国高等教育学会理事、江苏省比较文学学会理事、江苏省近现代史学会理事、江苏省侨联专家委员会委员等职。主要研究方向为近现代中外文学关系与文化交流史；近年来，在国内外知名学术刊物发表论文近50篇，出版中英文专著3部，主持国家社科项目多项。</span></p><p><span>推荐书目：陈力卫，《东往东来：近代中日之间的语词概念》，社会科学文献出版社2019年版。</span></p></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong>