ELTS等成绩证明材料（至少提供其中一项）；</span></p><p><span>（4）本科阶段成绩单（必传）：所在院校教务部门盖章的本科成绩单原件；</span></p><p><span>（5）本科阶段专业排名证明（必传）：所在院校教务部门盖章的本科前三年（或前5学期）的总评成绩专业排名证明；</span></p><p><span>（6）其他材料（非必传）：</span></p><p><span>如有与申请交流专业相关的代表性学术成果、学术论文或学术著作，可作为其他材料上传。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>参与福利</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>南京大学文学院已为报名成功并线下参与的营员备好专属福利：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>开放日定制文化衫一件</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2u8dY6WnMgNfpVSvCGpt653UuGcnHhLahLg9ia3PjmvcKHlLue1efdf2uAVFnptJAL5AiaiaJI7LQzKAtOkNNMMj8mt6znJZ5EHhCCGkAIsxqY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>文院专属主题礼包一套</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2u8dY6WnMgPMDchBOs9HU1gdEBgD964V4MyZaLvSlGAEcfAhRNiba0dpAI9ibNpH0qIiaeHGYIYOoHZptT239rTDrapKh8rSwGd7U1oCpGBhPE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/2u8dY6WnMgMx2I8hLWn3KEaibGfNQMyX8Xib5iavPskqOJbRPNAZFdAQujOVic02QoVE5guxHJSNQ3icBAtI3QYA2yoaDVDfB31N1IhVbMzva2UA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2u8dY6WnMgOWPtCxUdd858hnBmwhyPYgw6Vw7d5hRG6fA5eHqXQOGRmtMwOriaww6iasa7tctBTxA3b0kfuzl8DcXrhbCeKV2xuadJx88bSIQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_m